# Registration code kept although nothing outside tests reaches it. One per line: fn:<name> or event:<Type>, then why.
fn:bind_status   a getter on the Shortcuts page that only the integration tests read
event:ShareJobEvent   the share engine's event; no surface shows share progress yet
event:SharesChanged   the share engine's event; no surface lists shares yet
event:ShareDeleted   the share engine's event; no surface deletes shares yet
